                <![CDATA[<p>Nature Medicine, Published online: 08 September 2026; <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-026-04641-x">doi:10.1038/s41591-026-04641-x</a></p>A binding ban, and its limits: Japan legislates on heritable human genome editing]]></content:encoded>
